// Package store is the core's query layer, generated by sqlc from the SQL in
// queries/ against the schema in core/migrations.
//
// Run `make generate` after changing a query or a migration; `make lint`
// fails when the generated code (*.gen.go) is stale. Do not edit generated
// files.
//
// Queries is a thin, typed wrapper around SQL. Domain rules live above it:
// people, roles, devices and sessions are changed only through package
// identity, which writes an audit entry (package audit) in the same
// transaction as every change.
package store
